        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">At the beginning of each Fight phase, you can pick a single enemy INFANTRY unit within 1&quot; of this unit. Roll a D6 for each model in this unit; for each roll of a 6, the enemy unit suffers a mortal wound.</characteristic>
